      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782189563356,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Methods (Other language function)\n=-=-=========================\n\nA method is a block of code having particular name followed by \n() and can be used for performing a particular task.\n\nMethod do not run by their own.\n\nwe need to call it for execution.\n\nSteps required for method programming\n===================================\n1. Defining a method.\n2. Calling a method.\n\nsynatx of defining a method:\n______________________\n<access_modifier> <return_type> <method_name>(<arg>)\n{\n......\n.......\n..........\n}\n\nsynatx of calling  a method:\n_______________________\n<meethod_name>(<arg>);\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Methods (Other language function)\n=-=-=========================\n\nA method is a block of code having particular name followed by \n() and can be used for performing a particular task.\n\nMethod do not run by their own.\n\nwe need to call it for execution.\n\nSteps required for method programming\n===================================\n1. Defining a method.\n2. Calling a method.\n\nsynatx of defining a method:\n______________________\n<access_modifier> <return_type> <method_name>(<arg>)\n{\n......\n.......\n..........\n}\n\nsynatx of calling  a method:\n_______________________\n<meethod_name>(<arg>);\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
